# Revalidation trigger for OurBox Woodbox.
#
# Touching this file (updating its content) in a PR and merging to main
# triggers a new official-candidate build and publish without requiring a
# substantive source change. Use this after infrastructure maintenance,
# runner migrations, or when you need a fresh official artifact.
#
# Procedure:
#   1. Open a PR with a one-line change to this file (e.g., bump the date below).
#   2. Merge the PR to main.
#   3. The official-candidate workflow will trigger and publish new artifacts.
#
# This file is intentionally not in the paths-ignore list of official-candidate.yml.
#
